    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Provide a synthetic lookup table of pricing rate review parameters.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <div class="reference-rule">
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Parameter</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Basis</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr data-as-of="2026-02-01"><td>Rate review window</td><td>10 days <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-EST-0003" data-pv-body="Synthetic rate review window is 10 days under current guidance." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td><td>Current synthetic pricing guidance <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-2" data-pv="cite:2" data-pv-title="CL-EST-0003" data-pv-body="Synthetic rate review window is 10 days under current guidance." aria-label="Source 2">2</a> <span class="ref-as-of">As of <time datetime="2026-02-01">2026-02-01</time></span></td></tr>
<tr data-as-of="2026-02-01"><td>Escalation placeholder</td><td>3 percent <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-3" data-pv="cite:3" data-pv-title="CL-EST-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic escalation placeholder is 3 percent per year for fixture examples." aria-label="Source 3">3</a></td><td>Synthetic multi-year assumption <a class="cite-n" href="#cite-4" data-pv="cite:4" data-pv-title="CL-EST-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic escalation placeholder is 3 percent per year for fixture examples." aria-label="Source 4">4</a> <span class="ref-as-of">As of <time datetime="2026-02-01">2026-02-01</time></span></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>

      </div>
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <p>Look up the synthetic parameter in the table before updating a <span class="term" data-pv="term:cost_baseline" data-pv-title="cost baseline" data-pv-body="Synthetic time-phased budget basis used to measure synthetic estimating variance.">cost baseline</span>.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>Applying the 3 percent placeholder to a 1,000 USD base adds 30 USD for the synthetic year.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse a synthetic <span class="term" data-pv="term:rate_window" data-pv-title="rate window" data-pv-body="Synthetic period allowed to complete a forward pricing rate check.">rate window</span> with a binding forward pricing rate agreement.</p>

      
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="company-calibration">
      <h2 id="company-calibration">Company calibration</h2>
      
      <p>Confirm the multi-year escalation index <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="q:Q-002" data-pv-title="Q-002" data-pv-body="Which synthetic escalation index applies to multi-year pricing workbooks?">Q-002</span>.</p>

      
    </section>

